   "made": "2026-09-30T17:31:44.949Z"
  },
  "02": {
   "text": "A later historian, Sih-mah Chyen, says the philosopher Confucius studied it in old age.",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "voiceId": "hYDmtgsUa8Lf6Ql57aI5",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.75,
    "style": 0,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "seconds": 6.64,
   "sha256": "d83b3072377cbbd84c9b1089ed6197410e7bc38d0b424cd20937e3043022bc33",
   "made": "2026-09-30T17:31:51.075Z"
  },
  "03": {
   "text": "His copy was bamboo strips tied with leather cords. The cords wore through. Three times.",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "voiceId": "hYDmtgsUa8Lf6Ql57aI5",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.75,
    "style": 0,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "seconds": 7.2,
   "sha256": "569d9825c71d5bc1b4b60aa2dc6308c93f29d0091e0203d91cedeaa623716dd7",
   "made": "2026-09-30T17:31:56.751Z"
  },
  "04": {
   "text": "His collected sayings record a hope: more study, fewer serious mistakes.",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "voiceId": "hYDmtgsUa8Lf6Ql57aI5",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.75,
    "style": 0,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "seconds": 6.32,
   "sha256": "324feef771c7cee672179844813b05475ef1cc993be882d54231727ae6690643",
   "made": "2026-09-30T17:32:01.405Z"
  },
  "05": {
   "text": "Tradition credits him with the Ten Wings: explanations probably written later.",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "voiceId": "hYDmtgsUa8Lf6Ql57aI5",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.75,
    "style": 0,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "seconds": 5.68,
   "sha256": "211fed488986223263b272e4522fcd470797745bb1b311366500d71dbcc8b5d6",
   "made": "2026-09-30T17:32:06.859Z"
  },
  "06": {
   "text": "Six Lines reads it for judgment: what makes sense to do here.",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "voiceId": "hYDmtgsUa8Lf6Ql57aI5",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.75,
    "style": 0,
